{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>你是否經常按掉鬧鐘繼續賴床，結果每天匆匆忙忙出門？SnoozeBuster 是一款採用互動挑戰機制的鬧鐘應用，讓你無法輕易關閉鬧鐘，必須完成指定任務才能停響，從而徹底告別貪睡習慣。目前正限時免費，原價 US $0.99，抓緊機會下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x460x460bb-75-83.webp.pagespeed.ic.Bi7SdqJ0F0.webp\">\n<h2>三大挑戰模式</h2>\n<p>SnoozeBuster 提供三種喚醒挑戰：Wake Circles 要求你按住螢幕上移動的圓圈；Quick Math 則要你快速計算簡單數學題；Barcode Scan 更強制你起床掃描房間內預設的條碼。每種挑戰都能有效喚醒大腦，讓你徹底清醒，不再賴床。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-125-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.bB7qUyEL6e.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-126-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.E-26taeXdL.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-127-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.E-GllId_w4.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-128-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.EVPYUMA6_k.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-129-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.Olrx81dMLv.jpg\">\n<p>無需帳戶或訂閱，簡單實用，是告別貪睡習慣的最佳夥伴。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SnoozeBuster – Alarm Clock</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T09:38:08.621213+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}